      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marine_Corps_Air_Station_Cherry_Point",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In July 1957, the USAF established a Mobile Radar station at Cherry Point, guiding interceptor aircraft toward intruders.",
